{
 "duration": 211.266875,
 "units": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": "Intro",
   "text": "I am writing this on a computer in my college library, and I think I am being watched from the dark between the shelves.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 7.005
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I know how that sounds.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 7.305,
   "end": 8.694
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "But my best friend trusted the wrong person, and now he is gone.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 8.994,
   "end": 12.728
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "If you read nothing else, read this.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 13.028,
   "end": 14.883
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Let me take you back to the beginning.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 15.333,
   "end": 17.054
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": "A New Friend",
   "text": "Last year I met a guy named Jack.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 17.654,
   "end": 19.901
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "We liked the same games, the same films, even the same dumb jokes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 20.201,
   "end": 24.292
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "For the first time at that school, I had a real friend.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 24.592,
   "end": 27.688
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "We played online almost every night after class.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 27.988,
   "end": 30.891
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": "The Girl From Class",
   "text": "Then, last winter, Jack started seeing a girl from one of our classes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 31.491,
   "end": 35.73
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Her name was Elisa.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 36.03,
   "end": 37.321
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "At first she seemed kind, and I was honestly happy for him.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 37.621,
   "end": 41.22
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "But a month in, Jack began to pull away.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 41.52,
   "end": 43.934
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "He stopped answering.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 44.234,
   "end": 45.442
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "He only wanted to be with her.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 45.742,
   "end": 47.415
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": "Something Changed",
   "text": "One morning we were waiting in the cafeteria line.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 48.015,
   "end": 50.816
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I made a small joke, and Jack turned on me.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 51.116,
   "end": 53.814
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "\"This line is too long. I need to get out of here.\"",
   "who": "jack",
   "start": 54.114,
   "end": 56.549
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "He shouted at a girl behind us.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 56.849,
   "end": 58.778
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then he just ran out of the building.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 59.078,
   "end": 60.879
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "That was not my friend.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 61.179,
   "end": 62.531
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": "Better Than Ever",
   "text": "After that he stopped coming to class.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 63.131,
   "end": 65.147
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "One evening I passed Elisa in the hall and asked if Jack was okay.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 65.447,
   "end": 69.661
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "She smiled at me, and the smile was wrong.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 69.961,
   "end": 72.566
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "\"He is better than ever.\"",
   "who": "elisa",
   "start": 72.866,
   "end": 74.062
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "She said each word slowly, like a warning, and walked away.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 74.362,
   "end": 77.829
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": "The Phone Call",
   "text": "That night I called him, expecting nothing.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 78.429,
   "end": 80.851
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "He picked up at once.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 81.151,
   "end": 82.365
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "His voice was low and shaking, like a man trying to get out of a trap.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 82.665,
   "end": 86.808
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I told him I was coming over.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 87.108,
   "end": 89.047
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Forty minutes later he was at my door, and I knew something was badly wrong.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 89.347,
   "end": 93.905
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": "Black Tears",
   "text": "I let him in and turned off the lights because he begged me to.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 94.505,
   "end": 97.83
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "In the dark he was crying, but the tears were black, like ink running down his face.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 98.13,
   "end": 103.033
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "\"She did this to me. She caught me crying this stuff and said I was ready.\"",
   "who": "jack",
   "start": 103.333,
   "end": 106.614
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Ready for what, he did not know.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 106.914,
   "end": 108.709
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": "The Knock",
   "text": "Then a soft knock came at the door.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 109.309,
   "end": 111.076
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A girl's voice, calm and sweet.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 111.376,
   "end": 113.126
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "\"Jackie, I know you are in there. It is time. They are waiting for us.\"",
   "who": "elisa",
   "start": 113.426,
   "end": 117.135
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Jack jumped up, ran out the back, and vanished into the woods behind my building.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 117.435,
   "end": 122.157
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I called the police and chased after him.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 122.457,
   "end": 124.897
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Something hit the back of my head, and the world went black.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 125.197,
   "end": 128.39
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": "The Clearing",
   "text": "I woke tied to a tree.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 128.99,
   "end": 130.403
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "In a clearing in front of me stood a ring of figures in long black robes and pale blue masks.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 130.703,
   "end": 136.057
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "In the middle, strapped to a chair, was Jack.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 136.357,
   "end": 138.689
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "One of them lifted her mask.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 138.989,
   "end": 140.499
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It was Elisa.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 140.799,
   "end": 141.793
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A taller one opened an old black book and began to read.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 142.093,
   "end": 145.732
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "beat": 10,
   "chapter": "The Ritual",
   "text": "As the voice read, the ground began to shake.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 146.332,
   "end": 148.979
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "beat": 10,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Black tendrils rose from the frost like weeds and wrapped around Jack's chair.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 149.279,
   "end": 153.647
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "beat": 10,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "They pressed a cracked blue mask over his face.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 153.947,
   "end": 156.336
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "beat": 10,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Where his eyes had been, only black tar ran down.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 156.636,
   "end": 159.691
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "beat": 10,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "He was still alive, and I could not look away.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 159.991,
   "end": 162.58
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": "You Made Him Mad",
   "text": "Then, far off, I heard sirens.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 163.18,
   "end": 164.981
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The reader stopped.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 165.281,
   "end": 166.344
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "In the sudden quiet, a low laugh came from the chair.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 166.644,
   "end": 169.601
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "\"You made him mad.\"",
   "who": "jack",
   "start": 169.901,
   "end": 171.025
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The thing wearing my friend tore free of its straps and turned on the circle.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 171.325,
   "end": 175.502
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I will not describe what I heard next.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 175.802,
   "end": 177.897
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The frost went red, and the robed figures stopped screaming one by one.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 178.197,
   "end": 182.324
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": "What I Lost",
   "text": "I woke to a flashlight in my face and an officer shouting for help.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 182.924,
   "end": 186.98
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "They got me out.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 187.28,
   "end": 188.332
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "At the hospital they told me I would live, but one of my kidneys was gone.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 188.632,
   "end": 193.155
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A year has passed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 193.455,
   "end": 194.605
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Jack is still missing, blamed for ten deaths and one attempted murder.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 194.905,
   "end": 199.039
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Mine.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 199.339,
   "end": 199.887
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "beat": 13,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "This video is inspired by the story You Can't Trust Everyone, as published on an online horror story page.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 200.337,
   "end": 207.223
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "beat": 14,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "So tell me.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 207.673,
   "end": 208.562
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "beat": 14,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Who would you have trusted?",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 208.862,
   "end": 210.067
  }
 ]
}